[SPEAKER_01]: Understanding that pleasure to be the pain, not denying the fact that it's initially perceived as pleasurable, that will free one from sensual cravings.

17
00:02:18,658 --> 00:02:31,202
[SPEAKER_01]: And then, applying the same principle onto the nature of feeling in general, whereby whatever is being felt, you regard as disagreeable, because it was felt.

18
00:02:32,642 --> 00:02:34,263
