20
00:02:46,071 --> 00:02:47,952
[SPEAKER_01]: It cannot be controlled, it cannot be owned.

21
00:02:48,092 --> 00:02:49,213
[SPEAKER_01]: Thus, it's impermanent.

22
00:02:50,834 --> 00:02:51,494
[SPEAKER_03]: It has a reason.

23
00:02:51,875 --> 00:02:52,635
[SPEAKER_03]: It's impermanent.

24
00:02:54,196 --> 00:02:57,178
[SPEAKER_01]: And that is... and I said that this morning, that's the difference.

25
00:02:57,578 --> 00:03:00,500
[SPEAKER_01]: If you do that, then basically you free yourself from conceit further.

26
00:03:01,356 --> 00:03:09,061
